"],"ar":["دعم اختبارات الوحدة مع pytest","دعم اختبارات الدمج مع إعدادات ومحاكاة","قياس تغطية الكود","التكامل مع أنابيب CI/CD","دعم TDD (التطوير من خلال الاختبار)"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use code-testing","code-testing setup guide","TDD principles in code-testing","code-testing vs Jest","code-testing install for Python","code-testing for CI/CD pipeline integration"],"zh":["代码测试","TDD","单元测试","集成测试","代码覆盖率","CI/CD","AI工具","代码质量","pytest"],"ja":["コードテスト","TDD","ユニットテスト","統合テスト","コードカバレッジ","CI/CD","AIエージェント","コード品質","pytest"],"ko":["코드 테스팅","TDD","유닛 테스트","통합 테스트","코드 커버리지","CI/CD","AI 도구","코드 품질","pytest"],"es":["pruebas de código","herramientas de AI para pruebas de código","TDD","Pytest","cobertura de código","CI/CD","validación de código","pruebas unitarias","pruebas integrales"],"fr":["tests de code","outils d''IA pour tests de code","TDD","Pytest","couverture de code","CI/CD","validation de code","tests unitaires","tests intégraux"],"de":["Code-Tests","KI-Tools für Code-Tests","TDD","Pytest","Code-Coverage","CI/CD","Code-Validierung","Einheits-Tests","Integrations-Tests"],"pt":["teste de código","pytest","TDD","testes de unidade","testes de integração","cobertura de código","CI/CD","qualidade de código"],"ru":["тестирование кода","pytest","TDD","модульное тестирование","интеграционное тестирование","покрытие кода","CI/CD","качество кода"],"ar":["اختبار الكود","pytest","TDD","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات الدمج","تغطية الكود","CI/CD","جودة الكود"]}},"owner":"dredd-us","repo":"seashells","repoPath":"dredd-us/seashells","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.352Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-testing","description":"Generate and run unit and integration tests using pytest (Python) or Jest (JavaScript) with fixtures, mocks, and async support. Use for test-driven development, code review validation, coverage verification, and regression testing. Target 80%+ code coverage. Supports pytest markers, Jest snapshots, and CI/CD integration. Triggers on test, TDD, unit test, integration test, test coverage, pytest, jest.","bodyPreview":"# Code Testing\n\n## Purpose\n\nGenerate and run comprehensive unit and integration tests following TDD principles with proper fixtures, mocking, and coverage measurement.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Test-driven development (TDD)\n- Code review validation\n- Coverage verification\n- Regression testing\n- CI/CD pipeline integration\n- Ensuring code quality\n\n## Core Instructions\n\n### Python Unit Test (pytest)\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom my_module import calculate_total\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef sample_data():\n    \"\"\"F","body":"# Code Testing\n\n## Purpose\n\nGenerate and run comprehensive unit and integration tests following TDD principles with proper fixtures, mocking, and coverage measurement.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Test-driven development (TDD)\n- Code review validation\n- Coverage verification\n- Regression testing\n- CI/CD pipeline integration\n- Ensuring code quality\n\n## Core Instructions\n\n### Python Unit Test (pytest)\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom my_module import calculate_total\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef sample_data():\n    \"\"\"Fixture providing test data\"\"\"\n    return {\n        \"items\": [\n            {\"price\": 10.0, \"quantity\": 2},\n            {\"price\": 5.0, \"quantity\": 3}\n        ]\n    }\n\ndef test_calculate_total(sample_data):\n    \"\"\"Test total calculation\"\"\"\n    result = calculate_total(sample_data[\"items\"])\n    assert result == 35.0\n\ndef test_calculate_total_empty():\n    \"\"\"Test with empty list\"\"\"\n    result = calculate_total([])\n    assert result == 0.0\n\n@pytest.mark.asyncio\nasync def test_async_function():\n    \"\"\"Test async operations\"\"\"\n    result = await fetch_data()\n    assert result is not None\n    assert \"id\" in result\n```\n\n### JavaScript Test (Jest)\n\n```javascript\nimport { render, screen } from ''@testing-library/react'';\nimport { calculateTotal } from ''./utils'';\nimport Component from ''./Component'';\n\ndescribe(''calculateTotal'', () => {\n  test(''calculates total correctly'', () => {\n    const items = [\n      { price: 10, quantity: 2 },\n      { price: 5, quantity: 3 }\n    ];\n    expect(calculateTotal(items)).toBe(35);\n  });\n\n  test(''handles empty array'', () => {\n    expect(calculateTotal([])).toBe(0);\n  });\n});\n\ndescribe(''Component'', () => {\n  test(''renders correctly'', () => {\n    render(<Component />);\n    expect(screen.getByText(''Hello'')).toBeInTheDocument();\n  });\n\n  test(''handles async data'', async () => {\n    render(<Component />);\n    const data = await screen.findByTestId(''data'');\n    expect(data).toHaveTextContent(''Loaded'');\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Mocking External Dependencies\n\n**Python (unittest.mock):**\n```python\nfrom unittest.mock import Mock, patch\n\n@patch(''my_module.external_api_call'')\ndef test_with_mock(mock_api):\n    \"\"\"Mock external API\"\"\"\n    mock_api.return_value = {\"status\": \"success\"}\n\n    result = my_function()\n\n    assert result[\"status\"] == \"success\"\n    mock_api.assert_called_once()\n```\n\n**JavaScript (Jest):**\n```javascript\njest.mock(''./api'', () => ({\n  fetchData: jest.fn()\n}));\n\nimport { fetchData } from ''./api'';\n\ntest(''mocks API call'', async () => {\n  fetchData.mockResolvedValue({ status: ''success'' });\n\n  const result = await myFunction();\n\n  expect(result.status).toBe(''success'');\n  expect(fetchData).toHaveBeenCalledTimes(1);\n});\n```\n\n## TDD Workflow (Red-Green-Refactor)\n\n### 1. RED: Write Failing Test\n\n```python\ndef test_new_feature():\n    \"\"\"Test for feature that doesn''t exist yet\"\"\"\n    result = new_feature(input_data)\n    assert result == expected_output\n```\n\nRun test: `pytest` → ❌ FAILS (feature not implemented)\n\n### 2. GREEN: Implement Minimum Code\n\n```python\ndef new_feature(input_data):\n    \"\"\"Minimal implementation to pass test\"\"\"\n    return expected_output\n```\n\nRun test: `pytest` → ✅ PASSES\n\n### 3. REFACTOR: Improve Code\n\n```python\ndef new_feature(input_data):\n    \"\"\"Refactored implementation\"\"\"\n    # Clean, efficient implementation\n    return process(input_data)\n```\n\nRun test: `pytest` → ✅ STILL PASSES\n\n## Coverage Measurement\n\n### Python (pytest-cov)\n\n```bash\n# Run tests with coverage\npytest tests/ --cov=src --cov-report=html --cov-report=term\n\n# Generate HTML report\npytest --cov=src --cov-report=html\nopen htmlcov/index.html\n\n# Fail if coverage below threshold\npytest --cov=src --cov-fail-under=80\n```\n\n### JavaScript (Jest)\n\n```bash\n# Run tests with coverage\nnpm test -- --coverage\n\n# Coverage thresholds in jest.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  coverageThreshold: {\n    global: {\n      branches: 80,\n      functions: 80,\n      lines: 80,\n      statements: 80\n    }\n  }\n};\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Structure Tests (AAA Pattern)\n\n```python\ndef test_user_creation():\n    # ARRANGE: Setup test data\n    user_data = {\"name\": \"John\", \"email\": \"john@example.com\"}\n\n    # ACT: Execute the function\n    user = create_user(user_data)\n\n    # ASSERT: Verify results\n    assert user.name == \"John\"\n    assert user.email == \"john@example.com\"\n    assert user.id is not None\n```\n\n### Use Descriptive Names\n\n```python\n# Good\ndef test_calculate_total_with_discount_applied():\n    pass\n\n# Bad\ndef test_calc():\n    pass\n```\n\n### Test Edge Cases\n\n```python\ndef test_division_by_zero():\n    with pytest.raises(ZeroDivisionError):\n        divide(10, 0)\n\ndef test_empty_input():\n    result = process([])\n    assert result == []\n\ndef test_null_input():\n    result = process(None)\n    assert result is None\n```\n\n### Use Fixtures for Setup\n\n```python\n@pytest.fixture\ndef database():\n    \"\"\"Setup test database\"\"\"\n    db = create_test_db()\n    yield db\n    db.cleanup()\n\ndef test_with_db(database):\n    user = database.create_user(\"test\")\n    assert user.name == \"test\"\n```\n\n## CI/CD Integration\n\n### GitHub Actions\n\n```yaml\n- name: Run tests\n  run: |\n    pytest tests/ --cov=src --cov-report=xml\n\n- name: Upload coverage\n  uses: codecov/codecov-action@v3\n  with:\n    files: ./coverage.xml\n```\n\n### Output Formats\n\n**JUnit XML (for CI):**\n```bash\npytest --junitxml=test-results.xml\n```\n\n**JSON (for parsing):**\n```bash\npytest --json-report --json-report-file=report.json\n```\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nimport time\n\n@pytest.mark.benchmark\ndef test_performance(benchmark):\n    \"\"\"Benchmark function performance\"\"\"\n    result = benchmark(expensive_function, large_input)\n    assert result is not None\n\n@pytest.mark.timeout(5)\ndef test_timeout():\n    \"\"\"Test must complete within 5 seconds\"\"\"\n    result = slow_function()\n    assert result is not None\n```\n\n## Dependencies\n\n**Python:**\n- `pytest` - Test framework\n- `pytest-cov` - Coverage plugin\n- `pytest-asyncio` - Async test support\n- `pytest-mock` - Mocking utilities\n\n**JavaScript:**\n- `jest` - Test framework\n- `@testing-library/react` - React testing\n- `@testing-library/jest-dom` - Custom matchers\n\n## Version\n\nv1.0.0 (2025-10-23)\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:52.726Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated unit and integration testing with Pytest","zh":"非常适合需要利用 Pytest 进行自动化单元和集成测试的开发智能体。","ja":"Pytest を使用した自動化された単体テストと結合テストを必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Pytest를 이용한 자동화된 단위 및 통합 테스트가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan pruebas unitarias y de integración automatizadas con Pytest","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de tests unitaires et d''intégration automatisés avec Pytest","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die automatisierte Einheits- und Integrations-tests mit Pytest benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de testes de unidade e integração automatizados com Pytest","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы автоматизированные модульные и интеграционные тесты с Pytest","ar":"مثالي لوسائل تطوير العميل التي تحتاج إلى اختبارات وحدات وتكامل آلية مع Pytest"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and run comprehensive unit and integration tests following TDD principles, utilizing fixtures, mocking, and coverage measurement with libraries like Pytest, ensuring code quality and validation in CI/CD pipelines","zh":"使智能体能够遵循 TDD 原则，利用 Pytest 等库的 fixtures、mocking 和覆盖率测量功能，生成并运行全面的单元和集成测试，从而确保 CI/CD 流水线中的代码质量和验证。","ja":"TDD 原則に従い、Pytest などのライブラリのフィクスチャ、モッキング、カバレッジ測定を利用して、包括的な単体テストと結合テストを生成および実行するエージェントを強化し、CI/CD パイプラインにおけるコード品質と検証を保証します。","ko":"TDD 원칙을 따라 fixtures, mocking 및 Pytest와 같은 라이브러리를 사용한 커버리지 측정을 활용하여 포괄적인 단위 및 통합 테스트를 생성하고 실행하도록 에이전트를 지원하며, CI/CD 파이프라인에서 코드 품질과 검증을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y ejecutar pruebas unitarias e de integración comprehensivas siguiendo los principios de TDD, utilizando fixtures, mocking y medición de cobertura con bibliotecas como Pytest, garantizando la calidad y validación del código en pipelines de CI/CD","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et d''exécuter des tests unitaires et d''intégration complets suivant les principes de TDD, en utilisant des fixtures, du mocking et des mesures de couverture avec des bibliothèques comme Pytest, garantissant la qualité et la validation du code dans les pipelines de CI/CD","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Einheits- und Integrations-tests nach TDD-Prinzipien zu erstellen und auszuführen, indem sie Fixtures, Mocking und Abdeckungsmessungen mit Bibliotheken wie Pytest verwenden, um die Codequalität und -validierung in CI/CD-Pipelines sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e executar testes abrangentes de unidade e integração, seguindo os princípios do TDD, utilizando fixtures, mocking e medição de cobertura com bibliotecas como Pytest, garantindo a qualidade e validação do código em pipelines CI/CD","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и запускать комплексные модульные и интеграционные тесты, следующие принципам TDD, используя фикстуры,.mocking и измерение покрытия с помощью библиотек, таких как Pytest, обеспечивая качество и валидацию кода в конвейерах CI/CD","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء و تشغيل اختبارات شاملة للوحدات والتكامل، اتباعًا لمبادئ TDD، واستخدام الإعدادات والمحاكاة وقياس الغطاء مع مكتبات مثل Pytest، وضمان جودة و صحة البرنامج في خطوط أنابيب CI/CD"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test-driven development with Pytest","Validating code coverage and quality","Debugging regression issues in CI/CD pipelines"],"zh":["使用 Pytest 自动化测试驱动开发","验证代码覆盖率和质量","调试 CI/CD 流水线中的回归问题"],"ja":["Pytest を使用したテスト駆動開発の自動化","コードカバレッジと品質の検証","CI/CD パイプラインにおける回帰問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["Pytest를 사용한 테스트 주도 개발 자동화","코드 커버리지 및 품질 검증","CI/CD 파이프라인에서 회귀 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar el desarrollo basado en pruebas con Pytest","Validar la cobertura y calidad del código","Depurar problemas de regresión en pipelines de CI/CD"],"fr":["Automatiser le développement piloté par les tests avec Pytest","Valider la couverture et la qualité du code","Déboguer les problèmes de régression dans les pipelines de CI/CD"],"de":["Automatisieren von testgetriebenem Entwicklung mit Pytest","Validieren von Codeabdeckung und -qualität","Fehlerbehebung von Regressionen in CI/CD-Pipelines"],"pt":["Automatizar o desenvolvimento orientado a testes com Pytest","Validar a cobertura e qualidade do código","Depurar problemas de regressão em pipelines CI/CD"],"ru":["Автоматизировать разработку, ориентированную на тестирование, с помощью Pytest","Проверить покрытие и качество кода","Отладить проблемы регрессии в конвейерах CI/CD"],"ar":["أتمتة التطوير الموجه للاختبار باستخدام Pytest","التحقق من تغطية و جودة البرنامج","تصحيح مشاكل الانحدار في خطوط أنابيب CI/CD"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Pytest library dependency","Limited to unit and integration testing"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境","依赖 Pytest 库","仅限于单元和集成测试"],"ja":["Python 環境が必要","Pytest ライブラリへの依存","単体テストと結合テストに限定"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","Pytest 라이브러리 종속성","단위 및 통합 테스트로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Dependencia de la biblioteca Pytest","Limitado a pruebas unitarias e de integración"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Dépendance de la bibliothèque Pytest","Limité aux tests unitaires et d''intégration"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Abhängigkeit von der Pytest-Bibliothek","Begrenzt auf Einheits- und Integrations-tests"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Dependência da biblioteca Pytest","Limitado a testes de unidade e integração"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Зависимость от библиотеки Pytest","Ограничен тестированием модулей и интеграции"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","اعتماد المكتبة Pytest","محدود باختبارات الوحدات والتكامل"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"dae691026c67628a21b19e731c80e60e705379a3cffe8749783397a35e8d81a5","qualityScore":60}');
