detallados","fr":"Create a Plan est un outil d''indexation automatique pour Dojo qui transforme les idées en plans détaillés","de":"Create a Plan ist ein Tool für die automatische Dojo-Indexierung, das Ideen in detaillierte Pläne umwandelt","pt":"O Create-a-Plan é uma ferramenta de indexação automática que cria planos detalhados a partir de ideias ou especificações","ru":"Create-a-Plan - это ИИ Агент, который создает подробные планы из идей или спецификаций","ar":"Create-a-Plan هو أداة الفهرسة الآلية التي تنشئ خططاً مفصلة من الأفكار أو المواصفات"},"features":{"en":["Runs structured technical interviews to create detailed plans","Accepts input from spec or plan files (e.g., SPEC.md, PLAN.md, RFC.md)","Supports rough description or feature request as input","Outputs organized plans for parallel execution: foundations first, then independent workstreams","Enables merge and integration of workstreams","Generates plans for implementable and parallel execution"],"zh":["结构化技术访谈","自动化计划生成","并行执行输出","支持SPEC.md、PLAN.md、RFC.md文件","支持粗略的想法转化为详细计划"],"ja":["構造化された技術面接","自動化計画生成","並列実行出力","SPEC.md、PLAN.md、RFC.mdファイルのサポート","アイデアを詳細な計画に変換"],"ko":["구조화된 기술 면접","자동화된 계획 생성","병렬 실행 출력","SPEC.md、PLAN.md、RFC.md 파일 지원","아이디어를 상세한 계획으로 전환"],"es":["Ejecuta entrevistas técnicas estructuradas","Convierte ideas en planes detallados y ejecutables","Permite la ejecución paralela de planes","Soporta la indexación automática de Dojo","Utiliza archivos de especificación como SPEC.md o PLAN.md","Permite la descripción de ideas y requisitos de características"],"fr":["Exécute des entretiens techniques structurés","Transforme les idées en plans détaillés et exécutables","Permet l''exécution parallèle de plans","Prend en charge l''indexation automatique de Dojo","Utilise des fichiers de spécification tels que SPEC.md ou PLAN.md","Permet la description d''idées et de exigences de fonctionnalités"],"de":["Führt strukturierte technische Interviews durch","Wandelt Ideen in detaillierte und ausführbare Pläne um","Ermöglicht die parallele Ausführung von Plänen","Unterstützt die automatische Dojo-Indexierung","Verwendet Spezifikationsdateien wie SPEC.md oder PLAN.md","Ermöglicht die Beschreibung von Ideen und Funktionsanforderungen"],"pt":["Indexação automática para Dojo","Criação de planos detalhados a partir de ideias ou especificações","Organização de planos para execução paralela","Suporte a arquivos de especificação (SPEC.md, PLAN.md, RFC.md)"],"ru":["Автоматическая индексация для Dojo","Создание подробных планов из идей или спецификаций","Организация планов для параллельной выполнения","Поддержка файлов спецификации (SPEC.md, PLAN.md, RFC.md)"],"ar":["الفهرسة الآلية للدوجو","إنشاء خطط مفصلة من الأفكار أو المواصفات","تنظيم الخطط للتنفيذ الموازي","دعم ملفات المواصفات (SPEC.md, PLAN.md, RFC.md)"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use create-a-plan","create-a-plan alternative","create-a-plan setup guide","what is create-a-plan","create-a-plan vs Dojo","create-a-plan install","structured technical interview","parallel execution planning","independent workstreams management"],"zh":["AI工具","create-a-plan技能","自动化计划生成","结构化技术访谈","并行执行","SPEC.md","PLAN.md","RFC.md"],"ja":["AIエージェント","create-a-planスキル","自動化計画生成","構造化された技術面接","並列実行","SPEC.md","PLAN.md","RFC.md"],"ko":["AI 도구","create-a-plan 스킬","자동화된 계획 생성","구조화된 기술 면접","병렬 실행","SPEC.md","PLAN.md","RFC.md"],"es":["Create a Plan","indexer automático Dojo","entrevista técnica estructurada","planes detallados y ejecutables","ejecución paralela de planes","especificación de requisitos","herramientas de desarrollo de software","desarrollo de aplicaciones","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["Create a Plan","outils d''indexation automatique Dojo","entretien technique structuré","plans détaillés et exécutables","exécution parallèle de plans","spécification de exigences","outils de développement de logiciels","développement d''applications","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Create a Plan","automatische Dojo-Indexierung","strukturiertes technisches Interview","detaillierte und ausführbare Pläne","parallele Ausführung von Plänen","Spezifikation von Anforderungen","Entwicklungstools für Software","Anwendungsentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["Create-a-Plan","Ferramenta de indexação automática","Dojo","Plano de implementação","Especificação técnica","Indexação automática","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Create-a-Plan","ИИ Агент","Автоматическая индексация","Dojo","План реализации","Техническая спецификация","Индексация","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Create-a-Plan","أداة الفهرسة الآلية","الدوجو","خطة التنفيذ","المواصفات الفنية","الفهرسة الآلية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"dojoengine","repo":"torii","repoPath":"dojoengine/torii","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.365Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-a-plan","description":"Conduct a focused technical planning interview to produce an implementable, parallelizable plan or spec with clear dependencies, risks, and open questions.","bodyPreview":"# Create a Plan Skill\n\nThis skill runs a structured technical interview to turn a rough idea or an existing spec into a detailed, implementable plan. The output is organized for parallel execution: foundations first, then independent workstreams, then merge and integration.\n\n## Invocation\n\nThe user will provide one of:\n- A path to a spec or plan file (for example: `SPEC.md`, `PLAN.md`, `RFC.md`)\n- A rough description of what they want to build\n- A feature request or problem statement\n\nOutput is","body":"# Create a Plan Skill\n\nThis skill runs a structured technical interview to turn a rough idea or an existing spec into a detailed, implementable plan. The output is organized for parallel execution: foundations first, then independent workstreams, then merge and integration.\n\n## Invocation\n\nThe user will provide one of:\n- A path to a spec or plan file (for example: `SPEC.md`, `PLAN.md`, `RFC.md`)\n- A rough description of what they want to build\n- A feature request or problem statement\n\nOutput is always written to `PLAN.md` in the repo root.\n\n## Process\n\n### Phase 0: Preflight\n\n1. If a file path is provided, read it first and note goals, non-goals, constraints, and gaps.\n2. Confirm you will produce `PLAN.md` as the output in the repo root. If `PLAN.md` already exists, update it rather than creating a new file.\n\n### Phase 1: Discovery\n\nSummarize what is known, then identify missing details. Focus on:\n- Goals and non-goals\n- Constraints (time, budget, platform, dependencies)\n- Success metrics and acceptance criteria\n\n### Phase 2: Deep Interview\n\nUse the `AskUserQuestion` (Claude) and/or `request_user_input` (Codex) tools in rounds. Ask 1-3 questions per round. Each round should go deeper and avoid repeating what is already known.\n\nCRITICAL RULES:\n1. Never ask obvious questions. If the codebase or spec already answers it, do not ask it again.\n2. Ask about edge cases and failure modes.\n3. Probe for hidden complexity (state transitions, migrations, concurrency).\n4. Challenge assumptions when they create risk or ambiguity.\n5. Identify parallelization boundaries and serial dependencies.\n6. If the user is unsure, propose a default and ask for confirmation.\n\nQuestion categories to cover as relevant:\n- Technical architecture and data flow\n- Data model and state management\n- API contracts and versioning\n- Caching and invalidation\n- Background jobs, retries, and idempotency\n- Error handling and recovery\n- Observability and debugging\n- Performance, scale, and SLAs\n- Security, privacy, and compliance\n- Integrations and external dependencies\n- UX flows, accessibility, and responsiveness\n- Rollout, migration, and rollback\n- Testing strategy and validation\n\n### Phase 3: Dependency Analysis\n\nIdentify:\n1. Serial dependencies that must complete first\n2. Parallel workstreams that can run independently\n3. Merge points where work reconvenes\n\n### Phase 4: Plan Generation\n\nWrite the final plan to `PLAN.md`. Ensure the plan includes concrete verification steps the agent can run end to end. If the user only wants a plan in chat, provide it inline and mention that it would be written to `PLAN.md`.\n\n## Output Format\n\nThe generated plan MUST follow this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# [Feature Name] Implementation Plan\n\n## Overview\n[2-3 sentence summary of what this implements and why]\n\n## Goals\n- [Explicit goal 1]\n- [Explicit goal 2]\n\n## Non-Goals\n- [What this explicitly does NOT do]\n\n## Assumptions and Constraints\n- [Known constraints or assumptions]\n\n## Requirements\n\n### Functional\n- [Requirement]\n\n### Non-Functional\n- [Performance, reliability, security, compliance]\n\n## Technical Design\n\n### Data Model\n[Schema changes, new entities, relationships]\n\n### API Design\n[New endpoints, request/response shapes, versioning]\n\n### Architecture\n[System diagram in text or mermaid, component interactions]\n\n### UX Flow (if applicable)\n[Key screens, loading states, error recovery]\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Plan\n\n### Serial Dependencies (Must Complete First)\n\nThese tasks create foundations that other work depends on. Complete in order.\n\n#### Phase 0: [Foundation Name]\n**Prerequisite for:** All subsequent phases\n\n| Task | Description | Output |\n|------|-------------|--------|\n| 0.1 | [Task description] | [Concrete deliverable] |\n| 0.2 | [Task description] | [Concrete deliverable] |\n\n---\n\n### Parallel Workstreams\n\nThese workstreams can be executed independently after Phase 0.\n\n#### Workstream A: [Name]\n**Dependencies:** Phase 0\n**Can parallelize with:** Workstreams B, C\n\n| Task | Description | Output |\n|------|-------------|--------|\n| A.1 | [Task description] | [Concrete deliverable] |\n| A.2 | [Task description] | [Concrete deliverable] |\n\n#### Workstream B: [Name]\n**Dependencies:** Phase 0\n**Can parallelize with:** Workstreams A, C\n\n| Task | Description | Output |\n|------|-------------|--------|\n| B.1 | [Task description] | [Concrete deliverable] |\n\n---\n\n### Merge Phase\n\nAfter parallel workstreams complete, these tasks integrate the work.\n\n#### Phase N: Integration\n**Dependencies:** Workstreams A, B, C\n\n| Task | Description | Output |\n|------|-------------|--------|\n| N.1 | [Integration task] | [Concrete deliverable] |\n\n---\n\n## Testing and Validation\n\n- [Unit, integration, end-to-end coverage]\n- [Manual test plan if needed]\n\n## Rollout and Migration\n\n- [Feature flags, staged rollout, migration steps]\n- [Rollback plan]\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n- [Exact commands or manual steps the agent can run to verify correctness]\n- [Expected outputs or success criteria]\n\n## Risk Assessment\n\n| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |\n|------|------------|--------|------------|\n| [Risk description] | Low/Med/High | Low/Med/High | [Strategy] |\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- [ ] [Question that still needs resolution]\n\n## Decision Log\n\n| Decision | Rationale | Alternatives Considered |\n|----------|-----------|------------------------|\n| [Decision made] | [Why] | [What else was considered] |\n```\n\n## Interview Flow Example\n\nRound 1: High-Level Architecture\n- \"The spec mentions a sync engine. Is this push-based (webhooks), pull-based (polling), or event-driven (queue)?\"\n- \"What is the expected data volume and throughput?\"\n\nRound 2: Edge Cases\n- \"If a batch fails mid-run, do we retry the whole batch or resume from a checkpoint?\"\n- \"What happens when source data is deleted but still referenced downstream?\"\n\nRound 3: Parallelization\n- \"Can we process different categories independently, or are there cross-category dependencies?\"\n- \"Is there a natural partition key that allows sharding?\"\n\nRound 4: Operational\n- \"What is the acceptable latency for sync or processing?\"\n- \"How will operators debug failures and what visibility do they need?\"\n\n## Key Behaviors\n\n1. Persist until the plan is implementable and verifiable by the agent, but avoid user fatigue by batching questions.\n2. Challenge vague answers when they affect design decisions.\n3. Identify hidden work and operational overhead.\n4. Think about the merge and integration steps early.\n5. Summarize understanding and confirm before writing the final plan.\n\n## Completing the Interview\n\nAfter sufficient rounds of questions:\n1. Summarize your understanding back to the user\n2. Confirm the parallelization strategy\n3. Write the complete plan to the target file\n4. Ask if any sections need refinement\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:20.960Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Agents requiring structured project planning and parallel execution capabilities.","zh":"适合需要结构化项目规划和并行执行能力的技术代理","ja":"技術エージェントが構造化されたプロジェクト計画と並行実行機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 계획 및 병렬 실행 기능이 필요한 기술 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Técnicos que requieren una planificación de proyectos estructurada y capacidades de ejecución paralela.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents techniques nécessitant une planification de projet structurée et des capacités d''exécution parallèle.","de":"Ideal für technische Agenten, die eine strukturierte Projektplanung und parallele Ausführungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Técnicos que exigem planejamento de projeto estruturado e capacidades de execução paralela.","ru":"Идеально подходит для технических агентов, требующих структурированного планирования проекта и возможностей параллельного выполнения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الفنيين الذين يتطلبون تخطيط مشروع منظم وقدرات تنفيذ متوازي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform rough ideas into detailed, implementable plans using structured technical interviews, outputting organized plans in formats like SPEC.md or PLAN.md for efficient parallel execution and integration.","zh":"赋予代理将粗略的想法转化为详细、可实施的计划的能力，使用结构化的技术面试，输出以SPEC.md或PLAN.md等格式组织的计划，以实现高效的并行执行和集成","ja":"エージェントが構造化された技術面接を使用して、粗いアイデアを詳細で実行可能な計画に変換する能力を提供し、SPEC.mdまたはPLAN.mdなどの形式で整理された計画を出力して、効率的な並行実行と統合を実現","ko":"기술 에이전트가 조직된 기술 면접을 통해 대략적인 아이디어를 상세하고 구현 가능한 계획으로 변환할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 SPEC.md 또는 PLAN.md 형식의 구성된 계획을 출력하고 효율적인 병렬 실행 및 통합을 달성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar ideas rudimentarias en planes detallados e implementables utilizando entrevistas técnicas estructuradas, generando planes organizados en formatos como SPEC.md o PLAN.md para una ejecución paralela y integración eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées rudimentaires en plans détaillés et réalisables en utilisant des entretiens techniques structurés, produisant des plans organisés dans des formats comme SPEC.md ou PLAN.md pour une exécution parallèle et une intégration efficientes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, rohe Ideen mithilfe strukturierter technischer Interviews in detaillierte und umsetzbare Pläne umzuwandeln, die organisierten Pläne in Formaten wie SPEC.md oder PLAN.md für eine effiziente parallele Ausführung und Integration ausgeben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar ideias grosseiras em planos detalhados e implementáveis usando entrevistas técnicas estruturadas, produzindo planos organizados em formatos como SPEC.md ou PLAN.md para execução paralela eficiente e integração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить грубые идеи в подробные, реализуемые планы, используя структурированные технические интервью, выдавая организованные планы в форматах, таких как SPEC.md или PLAN.md, для эффективного параллельного выполнения и интеграции.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحويل الأفكار الخشنة إلى خطط مفصلة وقابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام المقابلات الفنية المنظمة ، وإنتاج خطط منظمة في تنسيقات مثل SPEC.md أو PLAN.md للتنفيذ المتوازي الفعال والتكامل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project planning for developers and project managers","Generating detailed plans from rough feature requests or problem statements","Organizing independent workstreams for parallel execution and merge"],"zh":["为开发人员和项目经理自动化项目规划","从粗略的功能请求或问题陈述生成详细的计划","组织独立的工作流以实现并行执行和合并"],"ja":["開発者とプロジェクトマネージャーのためのプロジェクト計画の自動化","粗い機能要求または問題文から詳細な計画を生成","並行実行とマージのために独立したワークフローを組織"],"ko":["개발자와 프로젝트 매니저를 위한 프로젝트 계획 자동화","대략적인 기능 요청 또는 문제 문장에서 상세한 계획 생성","병렬 실행 및 병합을 위한 독립적인 워크플로우 구성"],"es":["Automatización de la planificación de proyectos para desarrolladores y gerentes de proyecto","Generación de planes detallados a partir de solicitudes de características o declaraciones de problema rudimentarias","Organización de flujos de trabajo independientes para ejecución paralela y fusión"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification de projet pour les développeurs et les gestionnaires de projet","Génération de plans détaillés à partir de demandes de fonctionnalités ou de déclarations de problème rudimentaires","Organisation de flux de travail indépendants pour exécution parallèle et fusion"],"de":["Automatisierung der Projektplanung für Entwickler und Projektmanager","Erstellung detaillierter Pläne aus groben Funktionsanforderungen oder Problembeschreibungen","Organisation unabhängiger Arbeitsströme für parallele Ausführung und Zusammenführung"],"pt":["Automatizar o planejamento de projetos para desenvolvedores e gerentes de projetos","Gerar planos detalhados a partir de solicitações de recursos ou declarações de problemas grosseiras","Organizar fluxos de trabalho independentes para execução paralela e mesclagem"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование проектов для разработчиков и менеджеров проектов","Генерировать подробные планы из грубых запросов функций или заявлений о проблемах","Организовывать независимые потоки работы для параллельного выполнения и слияния"],"ar":["تأتمتة تخطيط المشاريع لمطوري البرامج ومديري المشاريع","توليد خطط مفصلة من طلبات الميزات أو بيانات المشاكل الخشنة","تنظيم تدفقات العمل المستقلة للتنفيذ المتوازي والدمج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires input in the form of a spec or plan file, a rough description, or a feature request","Output is structured for parallel execution, which may require additional coordination"],"zh":["需要以规范或计划文件、粗略描述或功能请求的形式输入","输出是为并行执行而结构化的，这可能需要额外的协调"],"ja":["仕様または計画ファイル、粗い説明、または機能要求の形式での入力が必要","出力は並行実行のために構造化されており、追加の調整が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["규격 또는 계획 파일, 대략적인 설명 또는 기능 요청의 형식으로 입력이 필요","출력은 병렬 실행을 위해 구조화되어 있으며, 추가적인 조정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una entrada en forma de archivo de especificación o plan, una descripción rudimentaria o una solicitud de característica","La salida está estructurada para la ejecución paralela, lo que puede requerir una coordinación adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée sous la forme d''un fichier de spécification ou de plan, d''une description rudimentaire ou d''une demande de fonctionnalité","La sortie est structurée pour l''exécution parallèle, ce qui peut nécessiter une coordination supplémentaire"],"de":["Benötigt eine Eingabe in Form einer Spezifikations- oder Plan-Datei, einer groben Beschreibung oder einer Funktionsanforderung","Die Ausgabe ist für die parallele Ausführung strukturiert, was eine zusätzliche Koordination erfordern kann"],"pt":["Exige entrada na forma de um arquivo de especificação ou plano, uma descrição grosseira ou uma solicitação de recurso","A saída é estruturada para execução paralela, o que pode exigir coordenação adicional"],"ru":["Требует ввода в виде файла спецификации или плана, грубого описания или запроса функции","Выходные данные структурированы для параллельного выполнения, что может потребовать дополнительной координации"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخالًا في شكل ملف مواصفات أو خطة ، أو وصفة خشنة أو طلب ميزة","الخرج منظم لتنفيذ متوازي ، والذي قد يتطلب تنسيقًا إضافيًا"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"76755dca1a8ade8c8e895de1efdf62f805b008bf3c8a9c427ad3a6c8bb1c1ddd","qualityScore":60}');
