von Dokumentation","README.md","Software-Entwicklung","Doc-Sync","Dokumentationsfähigkeiten","Konfiguration von Doc-Sync","Konfigurationsleitfaden für Doc-Sync"],"pt":["doc-sync","sincronização de documentação","arquitetura de documentação","self-documenting","README.md","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["doc-sync","синхронизация документации","архитектура документации","самодокументирующая","README.md","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["doc-sync","دمج التوثيق","هندسة التوثيق","التوثيق الذاتي","README.md","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"LixvYang","repo":"common-skills","repoPath":"LixvYang/common-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-sync","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Doc-Sync: Self-Documenting Architecture\n\nThis Skill enforces a strict documentation synchronization pattern where code changes automatically update all related documentation.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**Documentation = Code**: Any functional, architectural, or implementation change MUST update its corresponding documentation immediately after work completes.\n\n## Three-Level Documentation Structure\n\n### Level 1: Root Documentation (README.md)\n\nEvery project root MUST have a `README.md` that states:","body":"# Doc-Sync: Self-Documenting Architecture\n\nThis Skill enforces a strict documentation synchronization pattern where code changes automatically update all related documentation.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**Documentation = Code**: Any functional, architectural, or implementation change MUST update its corresponding documentation immediately after work completes.\n\n## Three-Level Documentation Structure\n\n### Level 1: Root Documentation (README.md)\n\nEvery project root MUST have a `README.md` that states:\n\n```markdown\n# Project Documentation Sync Contract\n\n**CRITICAL**: Any feature, architecture, or implementation update MUST update:\n1. This root README.md (high-level changes)\n2. The relevant folder''s folder.md (structure changes)\n3. All affected files'' header annotations (implementation changes)\n\nAfter completing ANY work, update documentation BEFORE committing.\n```\n\n### Level 2: Folder Documentation (folder.md)\n\n**Every folder** MUST contain a `folder.md` file with:\n\n```markdown\n# Folder Architecture\n\n## Overview (max 3 lines)\n[Brief description of this folder''s purpose and scope]\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Role | Function |\n|------|------|----------|\n| filename.ext | [role: controller/service/model/util] | [what it does] |\n| filename2.ext | [role] | [what it does] |\n\n---\n**SYNC ALERT**: If this folder changes (files added/removed/renamed), UPDATE THIS FILE.\n```\n\n**Example**:\n```markdown\n# src/auth Module\n\n## Overview\nAuthentication and authorization layer handling JWT validation, session management, and role-based access control.\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Role | Function |\n|------|------|----------|\n| index.ts | Controller | HTTP routing, request validation |\n| service.ts | Service | Business logic, token generation |\n| model.ts | Model | TypeBox schemas, DTOs |\n| middleware.ts | Middleware | Request interception, guards |\n\n---\nSYNC ALERT: If this folder changes, UPDATE THIS FILE.\n```\n\n### Level 3: File Header Annotations\n\n**Every source file** MUST start with:\n\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: [external dependencies: imports, env vars, services]\n * OUTPUT: [what this exports/provides: functions, types, values]\n * POSITION: [local role in system architecture: controller/service/model/util]\n *\n * SYNC: If this file changes, UPDATE this header AND the parent folder.md\n */\n```\n\n**Examples**:\n\n**Controller** (`index.ts`):\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: Request (Express/Elysia), body validation schemas\n * OUTPUT: HTTP responses, status codes, error handlers\n * POSITION: Entry point - handles HTTP layer only\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nimport { service } from ''./service''\n\nexport const handler = (req: Request) => service.process(req)\n```\n\n**Service** (`service.ts`):\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: Validated request data, database client, external APIs\n * OUTPUT: Business logic results, domain entities\n * POSITION: Core logic - decoupled from HTTP, pure business rules\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nexport const process = (data: Data) => { /* ... */ }\n```\n\n**Model** (`model.ts`):\n```typescript\n/**\n * INPUT: TypeBox/T, Zod, or validation library\n * OUTPUT: Validation schemas, TypeScript types, DTOs\n * POSITION: Data contract - defines interface between layers\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nimport { t } from ''elysia''\n\nexport const UserSchema = t.Object({ /* ... */ })\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nWhen creating or modifying code:\n\n1. **Before coding**: Read existing folder.md to understand context\n2. **During coding**: Focus on implementation\n3. **After coding (MANDATORY)**:\n   - Update file header (INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION)\n   - Update folder.md if structure changed\n   - Update README.md if architecture changed\n   - Commit ONLY after all docs updated\n\n## Commands\n\n### Create new file with template:\n```bash\n# Creates file with doc-sync header\ncat > src/newFile.ts << ''EOF''\n/**\n * INPUT: [TODO]\n * OUTPUT: [TODO]\n * POSITION: [TODO]\n *\n * SYNC: Update this header and ../folder.md on changes\n */\nEOF\n```\n\n### Check documentation coverage:\n```bash\n# Find folders missing folder.md\nfind . -type d -not -path \"*/node_modules/*\" -not -path \"*/.git/*\" | while read dir; do\n  if [ ! -f \"$dir/folder.md\" ]; then\n    echo \"Missing: $dir/folder.md\"\n  fi\ndone\n\n# Find files missing header annotations\ngrep -rL \"INPUT:\" src/ || echo \"All files have headers\"\n```\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nBefore committing, verify:\n\n- [ ] Root README.md updated (for architectural changes)\n- [ ] Every affected folder has folder.md\n- [ ] Every folder.md lists all files with roles\n- [ ] Every file has INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION header\n- [ ] SYNC reminders present in all folder.md and file headers\n- [ ] No \"TODO\" in INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION fields\n\n## Examples\n\nSee [examples/](examples/) for complete project structures:\n- `basic-auth/` - Simple auth module with full doc-sync\n- `ecommerce/` - Multi-module project\n- `api-service/` - Layered architecture\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Update immediately**: Don''t batch doc updates\n- **Be specific**: INPUT should list actual imports, not \"various\"\n- **Keep POSITION brief**: One line describing architectural role\n- **Folder overview max 3 lines**: Keep it scannable\n- **Use tables**: folder.md files section MUST use markdown table\n- **No exceptions**: Even test files need headers\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n❌ **Don''t**:\n- Leave \"TODO\" in headers\n- Update docs in separate PR\n- Skip folder.md for \"simple\" folders\n- Copy-paste headers without updating INPUT/OUTPUT\n- Write POSITION as \"utility file\" (be specific: \"validation utility for user input\")\n\n✅ **Do**:\n- Update docs as part of the same commit\n- Run validation checklist before push\n- Treat docs as code, not comments\n- Review folder.md changes in code review\n\n## Advanced: Nested Folder Sync\n\nFor deep hierarchies, each level updates its parent:\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── folder.md (mentions modules/ as subdirectory)\n└── modules/\n    ├── folder.md (lists auth/, user/ subdirs)\n    └── auth/\n        ├── folder.md (lists index.ts, service.ts, model.ts)\n        └── index.ts (has INPUT/OUTPUT/POSITION)\n```\n\nWhen `auth/index.ts` changes:\n1. Update its header\n2. Update `auth/folder.md`\n3. Update `modules/folder.md`\n4. Update `src/folder.md` (if role changed)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:18.890Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing automated documentation updates and synchronization.","zh":"适用于需要自动更新和同步文档的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード分析エージェントが自動的にドキュメントを更新および同期する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"코드 분석 에이전트가 자동으로 문서를 업데이트하고 동기화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan actualizaciones de documentación automatizadas y sincronización.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant des mises à jour de documentation automatisées et une synchronisation.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die automatisierte Dokumentationsaktualisierungen und Synchronisation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que precisam de atualizações de documentação automatizadas e sincronização.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Кодов, которым необходимы автоматические обновления документации и синхронизация.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى تحديثات وثائقية آلية وتزامن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain consistent and accurate documentation using a self-documenting architecture, enforcing a strict documentation synchronization pattern and utilizing Markdown files like README.md.","zh":"赋予代理使用自我记录的架构来维护一致和准确的文档，强制执行严格的文档同步模式，并利用Markdown文件，如README.md。","ja":"自律的にドキュメント化するアーキテクチャを使用してエージェントが一貫性と正確性のあるドキュメントを維持することを可能にし、厳格なドキュメントの同期パターンを適用し、README.mdなどのMarkdownファイルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 자기 문서화 아키텍처를 사용하여 일관성과 정확성을 갖춘 문서를 유지할 수 있도록 하며, 엄격한 문서 동기화 패턴을 적용하고 README.md와 같은 Markdown 파일을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener una documentación coherente y precisa utilizando una arquitectura auto-documentada, aplicando un patrón estricto de sincronización de documentación y utilizando archivos Markdown como README.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir une documentation cohérente et précise en utilisant une architecture auto-documentée, en appliquant un modèle strict de synchronisation de documentation et en utilisant des fichiers Markdown comme README.md.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, konsistente und genaue Dokumentationen mithilfe einer selbst-dokumentierenden Architektur zu pflegen, indem ein strenges Dokumentationssynchronisationsmuster angewendet und Markdown-Dateien wie README.md verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter documentação consistente e precisa usando uma arquitetura auto-documentada, aplicando um padrão estrito de sincronização de documentação e utilizando arquivos Markdown como README.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать последовательную и точную документацию, используя самодокументирующую архитектуру, обеспечивающую строгий шаблон синхронизации документации и использующую файлы Markdown, такие как README.md.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على توثيق متسق ودقيق باستخدام هندسة وثائقية ذاتية، وتنفيذ نمط متصرف لتنظيم التوثيق واستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل README.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation updates after code changes","Generating consistent project README files","Synchronizing architectural documentation with implementation changes"],"zh":["代码更改后自动更新文档","生成一致的项目README文件","将架构文档与实现更改同步"],"ja":["コードの変更後自動的にドキュメントを更新する","一貫性のあるプロジェクトのREADMEファイルを生成する","アーキテクチャドキュメントを実装の変更と同期する"],"ko":["코드 변경 후 자동으로 문서를 업데이트하는 것","일관된 프로젝트 README 파일을 생성하는 것","아키텍처 문서를 구현 변경과 동기화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de documentación después de cambios de código","Generación de archivos README de proyecto coherentes","Sincronización de documentación arquitectónica con cambios de implementación"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour de documentation après des changements de code","Génération de fichiers README de projet cohérents","Synchronisation de la documentation architecturale avec les changements d''implémentation"],"de":["Automatisierung von Dokumentationsaktualisierungen nach Codeänderungen","Erzeugung konsistenter Projekt-README-Dateien","Synchronisierung von Architekturdokumentation mit Implementierungsänderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação após alterações de código","Gerar arquivos README de projeto consistentes","Sincronizar documentação arquitetônica com alterações de implementação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации после изменений кода","Генерировать последовательные файлы README проекта","Синхронизировать архитектурную документацию с изменениями реализации"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحديثات الوثائق بعد تغييرات الشفرة","توليد ملفات README للمشروع المتسقة","تنظيم توثيق الهندسة المعمارية مع تغييرات التنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to codebase and documentation files","Enforces a specific three-level documentation structure"],"zh":["需要访问代码库和文档文件","强制执行特定的三层文档结构"],"ja":["コードベースとドキュメントファイルへのアクセスが必要","特定の3レベルのドキュメント構造を適用する"],"ko":["코드베이스와 문서 파일에 접근할 수 있어야 함","특정한 3단계 문서 구조를 적용함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código y archivos de documentación","Establece una estructura de documentación de tres niveles específica"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code et aux fichiers de documentation","Impose une structure de documentation à trois niveaux spécifique"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf den Codebasis und Dokumentationsdateien","Legt eine spezifische dreistufige Dokumentenstruktur fest"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código e arquivos de documentação","Aplica uma estrutura de documentação de três níveis específica"],"ru":["Требует доступа к базе кода и файлам документации","Применяет конкретную трехуровневую структуру документации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة وملفات التوثيق","ينفذ هيكلاً ثلاثي المستوى محددًا للتوثيق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7ca62ea69f6ae30fb5084fed5f90f8d0eba162406d5d4aec0f2cd074269bd5f1","qualityScore":60}');
