INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('lgbarn/shipyard/shipyard-testing', 'shipyard-testing', 'lgbarn', 'shipyard', 'community', 'shipyard-testing lgbarn shipyard community shipyard-testing is a plugin for Claude Code that structures project lifecycles with discipline, parallel agents, and quality gates, benefiting developers and teams. It aids in writing effective tests, setting up test infrastructure, and debugging. Shipyard-Testing是一个结构化项目生命周期的插件，支持从idea到生产的测试管理，包括平行代理和质量门控 Shipyard-Testingは、アイデアからプロダクションまでのプロジェクトライフサイクルを構造化するプラグインで、テストの自動化をサポートします Shipyard-Testing은 프로젝트 생명주기를 구조화하는 플러그인으로, 아이디어에서 프로덕션까지의 테스트 관리를 지원합니다 Shipyard-testing es un plugin de ciclo de vida de proyecto estructurado para Claude Code que ayuda a mejorar la calidad y eficiencia de las pruebas, desde la creación de tests unitarios hasta la integración con herramientas de testing. Shipyard-testing est un plugin de cycle de vie de projet structuré pour Claude Code qui aide à améliorer la qualité et l''efficacité des tests, de la création de tests unitaires à l''intégration avec des outils de testing. Shipyard-testing ist ein Plugin für den strukturierten Projekt-Lebenszyklus von Claude Code, das dabei hilft, die Qualität und Effizienz von Tests zu verbessern, von der Erstellung von Einheitstests bis zur Integration mit Testtools. O Shipyard-Testing é um plugin de ciclo de vida de projeto estruturado para Claude Code, que ajuda a manter a disciplina e a qualidade dos testes Shipyard-Testing — это структурированный плагин жизненного цикла проекта для Claude Code, который помогает поддерживать дисциплину и качество тестирования Shipyard-Testing هو مكون إضافي لم цикل حياة المشروع المنظم ل Claude Code، الذي يساعد في الحفاظ على الانضباط وجودة الاختبارات how to use shipyard-testing shipyard-testing vs claude code shipyard-testing setup guide what is shipyard-testing shipyard-testing alternative shipyard-testing install structured project lifecycle claude code plugin effective testing strategies Shipyard-Testing AIエージェント 测试自动化 项目生命周期管理 平行代理 质量门控 测试文件 测试基础设施 单元测试 集成测试 E2E测试 Writes effective tests for various file formats like *.test.*, *.spec.*, *_test.go, and test_*.py Sets up test infrastructure and utilities for efficient testing Debugs flaky, brittle, or slow tests for improved test reliability Decides between unit, integration, and E2E tests for comprehensive coverage Chooses when and how to use mocks, stubs, or fakes for effective test isolation shipyard-testing is a structured project lifecycle plugin for Claude Code, enabling disciplined development from idea to production with features like parallel agents and quality gates.');
